OL,3,AGas bill standing charges to be
OL,4,Ascrapped for millions, chancellor says,
OL,5,Aahead of Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey will set out the
OL,8,Fgovernment's tax and spending plans
OL,9,Fwhen he unveils the Budget at 12:30 GMT
OL,10,F- here's how the day will unfold
OL,12,FThe government has promised a plan that
OL,13,F"moves money and power out of
OL,14,FWestminster", but ministers face
OL,15,Fpressure on the cost of living and
OL,16,Ffunding defence
