OL,3,AGas bill standing charges to be
OL,4,Ascrapped for millions, chancellor says,
OL,5,Aahead of Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis first Budget of Andy Burnham's
OL,8,Fpremiership is due to shield some
OL,9,Fpensioners from income tax and increase
OL,10,Fthe minimum wage - though the BBC
OL,11,Funderstands 18- to 20-year-olds are set
OL,12,Fto see lower increases than in previous
OL,13,Fyears
OL,15,FIt comes as inflation hit 3.5% in the
OL,16,F12 months to September, largely driven
OL,17,Fby soaring fuel prices amid the war in
OL,18,FIran
